                        "description": "Set of [key-value pairs](https://docs.stripe.com/api/metadata) that will declaratively set metadata on [Subscriptions](https://docs.stripe.com/api/subscriptions) generated from this payment link. Unlike object-level metadata, this field is declarative. Updates will clear prior values.",
